OL,3,GNEWSALorry oil spill closes motorway
OL,4,Afor hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of motorway was closed after
OL,7,Fa lorry left a "significant" oil spill
OL,8,Facross the carriageway.
OL,10,FThe southbound M61 in Greater
OL,11,FManchester was shut between Junction 4
OL,12,Fnear Bolton and Junction 2 shortly
OL,13,Fbefore 09:30 BST while the road was
OL,14,Fcleared.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the HGV spilled
OL,17,Foil across two lanes, stretching for a
OL,18,Fdistance of about 2km (1.2 mile).
